{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"0a150ead-d2ee-40e5-85c7-0c8c2f022337","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The integration issues with Intervals.icu have been identified and resolved, with the causes documented in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-8u9Cy5/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Causes \u0026 Fixes\n\n1. **Connect Button 401 Unauthorized**:\n   - **Cause**: The \"Connect Intervals.icu\" link in [app.js](file:///tmp/h-8u9Cy5/static/app.js) performed standard browser document navigation (`\u003ca href=\"/api/intervals/auth/init\"\u003e`), omitting the athlete's token stored in `localStorage`. [server.py](file:///tmp/h-8u9Cy5/server.py) only inspected `Authorization: Bearer` headers.\n   - **Fix**: Updated [app.js](file:///tmp/h-8u9Cy5/static/app.js) to pass the token as a query parameter (`/api/intervals/auth/init?token=...`) and updated [`current_user`](file:///tmp/h-8u9Cy5/server.py#L149-L159) in [server.py](file:///tmp/h-8u9Cy5/server.py) to accept authentication via header or query token.\n\n2. **HTTP 400 `invalid_request` on Intervals.icu Consent**:\n   - **Cause**: [config.py](file:///tmp/h-8u9Cy5/config.py) specified `SCOPES = \"ACTIVITY:READ,ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\"`. On Intervals.icu, `:WRITE` implies `:READ`, and requesting duplicate permission categories results in a duplicate scope error.\n   - **Fix**: Cleaned scopes in [config.py](file:///tmp/h-8u9Cy5/config.py) to `\"ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\"`.\n\n3. **Status Expired After 1 Hour**:\n   - **Cause**: Intervals.icu issues long-lived access tokens without an `expires_in` or `refresh_token` field. [server.py](file:///tmp/h-8u9Cy5/server.py) defaulted missing expiry to 3600 seconds (`DEFAULT_TOKEN_TTL = 3600`). After 1 hour, [`refresh_tokens`](file:///tmp/h-8u9Cy5/server.py#L86-L110) failed due to the absence of a refresh token and invalidated the connection.\n   - **Fix**: Adjusted `DEFAULT_TOKEN_TTL` to `None` in [server.py](file:///tmp/h-8u9Cy5/server.py) and updated token storage and the refresher loop so tokens without explicit expiration do not expire.\n","duration_seconds":127.366744,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":130890,"output_tokens":6809,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":477631,"total_tokens":137699}}}
